. Pellham is the largest single buyer of grid equipment in Caldria.\n- **Funding risk for utilities:** Funding is tighter but not blocking. Utility bond spreads widened 30bp in Q3 2026 to 165bp. Norvane still priced a C$1.1B bond comfortably. Two utility share offerings were cut back in size, so there is a modest risk that capex gets scaled back.\n- **Data centres:** Grid connection requests from data centres are expected to grow 9% in 2027. That is slower than in 2026 because power availability limits new sites. I'm using connection requests as a proxy for equipment demand.\n\n**Limits of the evidence:**\n- It rests on a few short documents covering only two utilities.\n- It has no direct measure of equipment orders, no manufacturer backlogs, and nothing on 2028 or later.\n- The utility capex documents don't say how much of the spending is driven by data centres.\n\nDetail is in n7.r1 (utilities) and n8.r1 (data centres).","ttft_ms":2925,"type":"result","duration_ms":29505,"uuid":"98945e2a-1ff8-4105-899e-8ee2abc05b3b","ttft_stream_ms":1722,"time_to_request_ms":327,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":11,"system_prompt":4,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":7,"input_attachments":26,"input_hooks":5,"conversation_append":0,"transcript_persist":22,"tool_pool_refresh":0,"init_message":50,"init_frame_send":10,"engine_pickup":2,"loop_entry":18,"message_prep":1,"model_config_wait":2,"autocompact":12,"request_announcements":102,"query_setup":0,"model_gates":4,"tool_schema_build":4,"message_normalization":6,"client_creation":12,"request_build":29},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":219,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":162,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":204,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":131,"process_rss_mib_result":202,"process_anon_mib_result":121,"process_peak_rss_mib":218,"process_cpu_ms_turn":660,"process_wall_ms_turn":29504,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":62,"process_wall_ms_streaming":2302,"main_strea